<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged up to 1.8790 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged up to 1.8790 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8790 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1,8825 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 30	   January 29</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8790		 1.8825</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $7.66 million	    $9.86 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
